{"id":"vod_sn_35917","vodId":"35917","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"属性同好会","name_cn":"属性同好会","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/c6fe2f73be1ac372d0cd5aeaa92ded13.jpg"},"summary":"不良少年风间坚次（小西克幸 配音）就读高中二年级，与横缟、长山组成不良少年团体“风间一派”。就是这么一个横行于校园之内的不良学生，在一次偶然的机会中，闯进了因成员太少面临废部的“游戏制作部”，遇到隶属该部的四名女子成员，她们自称身怀各自的“属性”——炎属性的柴崎芦花（花泽香菜 配音）、土属性的乌山千岁、水属性的水上樱以及雷属性的大泽南。面对这种超现实的社团，坚次当然不肯加入，于是她们四人运用各自属性技能，对坚次发起攻击，目的就是让他加入。坚次不仅得面对四名带着“属性”的成员，还要对付随之而来的所谓“真正的游戏制作部”……　　改编自日本漫画家春野友矢的漫画作品。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:50","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H5LWtWyqMH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tzv2GJUUsK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qBT83NkK4J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bDW6Bus9nx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5N1NZUTy0h1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/R7QET0ZDB51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HYKrGM8Tf31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yWwWrxeptA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qPeB1Wb6371/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZAaeTnaStU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hjCRDe4Rsk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Uq2knn5Uw51/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:29.080Z"}